      is broadcastable to the shape of `t`.
    clip_value_max: The maximum value to clip to. A scalar `Tensor` or one that
      is broadcastable to the shape of `t`.
    name: A name for the operation (optional).

  Returns:
    A clipped `Tensor` or `IndexedSlices`.

  Raises:
